---
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout title="Aurora — A computing ecosystem built around Aurora OS" description="Aurora is an independent computing ecosystem centered on Aurora OS, with Lumen as its browser workstream. The project is in development and has no public release yet.">
  <section class="home-cinema">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="home-cinema-inner">
        <div class="home-cinema-copy">
          <h1>Aurora.<br /><span>A world of its own.</span></h1>
          <p class="home-cinema-description">An independent computing ecosystem built around Aurora OS. Lumen, the Aurora Browser, is part of the same vision. Both are in development.</p>
          <div class="home-cinema-actions">
            <a class="button button-primary" href="/en/ecosystem/os/">Explore Aurora OS <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a>
            <a class="text-link" href="/en/ecosystem/">Explore the ecosystem</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="home-cinema-art">
          <img src="/aurora-hero.svg" alt="Aurora's geometric symbol above a luminous planetary horizon" width="760" height="480" fetchpriority="high" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-products-cinema shell" id="ecosystem" aria-label="Aurora ecosystem">
    <article class="home-cinema-product home-cinema-product-primary">
      <div class="home-cinema-product-copy">
        <h2>Aurora <span>OS</span></h2>
        <p>The heart of the Aurora ecosystem: an operating system being built from scratch in Rust. The project is focused on a secure, reliable and adaptable foundation for personal computing.</p>
        <p class="home-release-note">In development · No public release yet</p>
        <a class="home-cinema-link" href="/en/ecosystem/os/">Discover Aurora OS <span>↘</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="home-concept home-concept-os" role="img" aria-label="Conceptual visual representing Aurora OS, not a product screenshot">
        <div class="home-os-ring"></div><div class="home-os-horizon"></div><div class="home-os-core"><span>AU</span></div>
        <span class="home-concept-caption">AURORA OS</span>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="home-cinema-product home-cinema-product-secondary">
      <div class="home-cinema-product-copy">
        <h2>Lumen</h2>
        <p>The browser workstream of the Aurora ecosystem. It is being developed alongside Aurora OS as part of one connected computing experience.</p>
        <p class="home-release-note">In development · Not released</p>
        <a class="home-cinema-link" href="/en/ecosystem/browser/">Discover Lumen <span>↘</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="home-concept home-concept-lumen" role="img" aria-label="Conceptual browser interface for Lumen, not a product screenshot">
        <div class="home-lumen-window">
          <div class="home-lumen-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><div class="home-lumen-address"></div></div>
          <div class="home-lumen-page"><small>LUMEN</small><strong>Clarity<br /><em>over noise.</em></strong></div>
        </div>
        <span class="home-concept-caption">LUMEN BROWSER</span>
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="home-cinema-end shell">
    <div><h2>Not released yet.</h2><p>Aurora is still being built. There are no public installers or user documentation at this stage.</p></div>
    <a class="home-cinema-link" href="/en/downloads/">Release availability <span>↘</span></a>
  </section>
  <style>
    .home-cinema { overflow:visible; padding:clamp(72px,10vw,132px) 0 60px; }
    .home-cinema-inner { min-height:0; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.95fr) minmax(0,1.05fr); gap:clamp(24px,4vw,64px); }
    .home-cinema-copy { min-width:0; }
    .home-cinema h1 { max-width:620px; font-size:clamp(54px,7vw,92px); line-height:.98; letter-spacing:-.075em; }
    .home-cinema-description { max-width:470px; }
    .home-cinema-art { min-width:0; width:100%; min-height:0; overflow:visible; }
    .home-cinema-art img { display:block; width:100%; max-width:650px; height:auto; object-fit:contain; object-position:center; }
    .home-products-cinema { padding-block:clamp(60px,9vw,120px); }
    .home-cinema-product { gap:7vw; padding-block:70px; }
    .home-cinema-product-primary { grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr; }
    .home-cinema-product-secondary { grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr; }
    .home-cinema-product h2 { margin:0 0 20px; font-size:clamp(38px,5vw,64px); }
    .home-cinema-product-copy > p:not(.home-release-note) { max-width:480px; color:#a9bbc5; font:14px/1.8 var(--display); }
    .home-release-note { margin:24px 0 18px; color:var(--accent); font:10px var(--mono); letter-spacing:.04em; }
    .home-cinema-end { align-items:center; }
    .home-cinema-end h2 { margin:0 0 12px; font:600 clamp(28px,4vw,44px)/1.05 var(--display); letter-spacing:-.05em; }
    .home-cinema-end p { max-width:600px; }
    @media(max-width:760px) {
      .home-cinema { overflow:visible; padding:58px 0 38px; }
      .home-cinema .shell,.home-products-cinema,.home-cinema-end { width:calc(100% - 40px); }
      .home-cinema-inner { display:flex; min-height:0; flex-direction:column; align-items:stretch; gap:18px; }
      .home-cinema-copy { width:100%; }
      .home-cinema h1 { font-size:clamp(46px,12vw,68px); }
      .home-cinema-description { max-width:100%; font-size:14px; }
      .home-cinema-art { display:block; width:100%; height:auto; min-height:0; margin:0; padding:0; }
      .home-cinema-art img { width:100%; max-width:100%; height:auto; max-height:none; object-fit:contain; }
      .home-cinema-actions { align-items:flex-start; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:18px; }
      .home-products-cinema { padding-block:50px; }
      .home-cinema-product,.home-cinema-product-primary,.home-cinema-product-secondary { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:20px; padding-block:42px; }
      .home-concept { width:100%; min-height:260px; }
      .home-cinema-end { align-items:flex-start; flex-direction:column; padding-block:42px 58px; }
    }
  </style>
</SiteLayout>